Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.18,0:03:32.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第3季第5集]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.44,0:00:12.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(忆往昔)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.13,0:01:10.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(如今)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.17,0:01:20.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(很久很久以前  所有住宅都建得这么好)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.64,0:01:25.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.27,0:03:37.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.13,0:11:39.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(急诊)
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.81,0:15:59.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(坎伯兰郡中央图书馆)
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.02,0:20:56.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(格林兄弟)
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.48,0:21:44.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(卡·加里森)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.16,0:00:04.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, dad's gone now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.41,0:00:06.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得继承他的遗志\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to carry out his legacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.37,0:00:09.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能猎杀多少凶鬼恶灵杀多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hunting down as many evil sons of bitches as we possibly can.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.79,0:00:14.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,1835年\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back in 1835,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.21,0:00:16.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,萨穆埃尔·柯尔特为一位猎人造了把枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Samuel Colt made a gun for a hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.38,0:00:18.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这枪能杀任何东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}This gun can kill anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.09,0:00:20.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只剩四颗子弹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only four bullets left.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.34,0:00:25.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有子弹  枪也没用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without them, this gun is useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.76,0:00:27.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它现在唯一的用处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, the only thing it's good for now,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.14,0:00:28.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是研究明白它的原理\N{\fnArial\fs30}is figuring out what makes it tick.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.68,0:00:30.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,枪不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cute piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.77,0:00:31.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打不死恶魔的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Won't stop a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.73,0:00:32.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}How the hell would you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.73,0:00:34.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算是合理推测吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call it an educated guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.48,0:00:38.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你到底要不要我帮你修枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want me to help you out with that gun or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.44,0:00:41.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为救萨姆做的交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}That deal you made to save Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.07,0:00:42.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只剩一年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A year to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.99,0:00:44.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实还挺让人觉得解脱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been kind of liberating, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.53,0:00:45.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不怕吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.33,0:00:50.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.33,0:00:52.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有多确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}How certain are you 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.44,0:00:54.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你复活的\N{\fnArial\fs30}that what you brought back...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.12,0:00:56.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是百分百纯粹的萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}is 100 percent pure Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.92,0:00:58.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得我弟弟是不是有毛病\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think something's wrong with my brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.92,0:01:00.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恶魔都撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Demons lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.01,0:01:02.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,萨姆肯定没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure Sam's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.93,0:01:04.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也这么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.11,0:01:22.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你负责转块  我负责木材\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the brick guy, I'm the wood guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.86,0:01:24.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一直都是如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the way it's always been.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.11,0:01:25.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就是需要你挑砖块的颜色\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just need someone to pick the color of the bricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.74,0:01:27.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  埃米特  那只能你来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Emmett, you know what, that has gotta be you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.45,0:01:28.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不关我事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not my responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.41,0:01:31.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.37,0:01:33.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道  狗吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. A dog, maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.75,0:01:35.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 狗这么大动静  - 好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's a hell of a dog. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.83,0:01:37.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早上工人就来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got a crew coming in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.29,0:01:38.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看看这木材\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at this wood, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.63,0:01:40.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看啊  烂成什么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at it. It's crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.00,0:01:40.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在哪订的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where'd you order it from?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.75,0:01:42.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是以往那地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same place as always.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.26,0:01:44.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该按我的意思用煤渣砖的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should've used the cinder block like I wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.51,0:01:45.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what, here we go again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.80,0:01:46.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不是负责人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not in charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.80,0:01:47.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们真是群小姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, you're a bunch of girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.89,0:01:49.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,关键是这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, it comes down to this, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.76,0:01:52.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一股劲风  就能把整栋房子吹倒\N{\fnArial\fs30}One gust of wind and the whole place is gonna blow over.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.52,0:01:53.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯嗯  随你说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.52,0:01:57.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你们听到了吗  - 听到什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did you hear that? - Hear what?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.22,0:02:27.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,凯尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kyle,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.26,0:02:29.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来  我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}come on, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.14,0:02:30.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  我先去给卡车热车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I'm gonna go warm up the truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.77,0:02:44.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.57,0:02:45.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.53,0:02:48.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.09,0:03:50.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不懂  迪恩  为什么不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand, Dean. Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.84,0:03:52.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我说了不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I said so.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.59,0:03:54.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们现在有柯尔特枪了  - 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We got the Colt now. - Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.26,0:03:55.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们可以召唤十字路口恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can summon the Crossroads Demon...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.97,0:03:57.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们不能召唤什么  - 拿枪指着她\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're not summoning anything. - Hold the gun on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.02,0:03:57.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,逼她\N{\fnArial\fs30}And force her to
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.72,0:03:58.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 解除你的交易  - 我们都不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- let you out of the deal. - We don't even know
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.27,0:03:59.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那能不能行\N{\fnArial\fs30}if that'll work.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.10,0:04:00.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我们就直接打死她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well then, we'll just shoot her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.06,0:04:01.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果她死了  交易就解除了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If she dies, the deal goes away.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.14,0:04:02.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们也不知道那能不能行  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't know if that'll work, either, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.69,0:04:03.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你现在跟我说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All you're pitching me right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.69,0:04:06.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是如果  可能  这不够好\N{\fnArial\fs30}is a bunch of ifs and maybes and that's not good enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.40,0:04:08.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为如果我们敢钻交易的空子  你会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}because if we screw with this deal, you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.69,0:04:09.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我们不钻空子  你就会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if we don't screw with it, you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.90,0:04:12.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,萨姆  够了  我们不想再谈这个了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, enough, I'm not gonna have this conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.11,0:04:13.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么  因为你说了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? Because you said so?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.16,0:04:14.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  因为我说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, because I said so!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.32,0:04:15.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可不是爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you're not Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.87,0:04:20.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  但我是老大\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, but I am the oldest.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.75,0:04:22.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在做最好的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm doing what's best.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.29,0:04:24.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就别提这事了  明白了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna let this go, you understand me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.51,0:04:35.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟我说说那个疯子杀手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me about the psychotic killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.64,0:04:37.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点  萨姆  跟我说说那个疯子杀手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Sam, tell me about the psychotic killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.14,0:04:39.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,疯子杀手\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Psychotic killer:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.10,0:04:43.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,凶残撕碎被害人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rips victims apart with brute-like ferocity."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.14,0:04:45.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  有提到他的尖牙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, any mention of his razor-sharp teeth,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.02,0:04:47.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或利爪  或动物眼吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}or his 4-inch claws, animal eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.44,0:04:48.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.65,0:04:50.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,月相是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The lunar cycle's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.28,0:04:53.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果是狼人  我们时间不多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, if it is a werewolf, we don't have long.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.82,0:04:54.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本周五就是满月了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moon's full this Friday.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.99,0:04:56.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他要过一个月才会再变身\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's the last time he changes for a month.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.91,0:04:59.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两天  不紧张\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two days, no sweat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.71,0:05:04.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是普兰特警探  这是佩吉警探\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Detective Plant, this is Detective Page.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.54,0:05:06.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们是郡警局的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're with the County Sheriff's Department.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.50,0:05:08.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  我一直在等你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, uh, been expecting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.88,0:05:09.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.05,0:05:10.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一早上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.05,0:05:13.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们是素描师吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are the sketch artist, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.09,0:05:16.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.47,0:05:17.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 对  - 是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.55,0:05:19.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我搭档就是素描师\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is exactly who my partner is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.64,0:05:21.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他简直是神笔啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the things he can do with a pen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.52,0:05:23.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着  开始那个之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, listen, before we get started on that,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.81,0:05:24.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们想问你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted to ask you...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.35,0:05:26.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么逃掉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}how'd you get away?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.44,0:05:29.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I... I have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.94,0:05:31.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我躲了起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was hiding...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.40,0:05:34.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他发现了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he found me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.03,0:05:38.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他都冲我扑过来了  可又突然停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was coming right for me and then he just stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.74,0:05:41.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,眼神空洞地盯着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stared at me with this blank look.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.33,0:05:46.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,之后  他就跑开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}After that, he just took off running.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.04,0:05:49.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.21,0:05:54.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我需要你尽量回忆他的身体特征细节\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna need as much physical detail as you can remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.97,0:05:56.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.80,0:05:59.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他大概一米八多\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was about 6 feet tall.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.85,0:06:01.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一米八\N{\fnArial\fs30}Six...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.35,0:06:02.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dark hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.06,0:06:07.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的眼睛呢  是什么颜色的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about his eyes? What color eyes did he have?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.52,0:06:09.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能是蓝色的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe blue?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.19,0:06:11.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 当时很黑  - 蓝色的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It was dark. - Blue?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.69,0:06:14.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的眼睛看上去像动物吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did they seem, uh, ahem, animalish?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.86,0:06:15.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.95,0:06:19.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的牙呢  你注意到什么异常之处了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about his teeth? You notice anything strange about them?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.57,0:06:21.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没  就是普通的牙\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, they were just teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.03,0:06:23.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,牙  好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Teeth. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.66,0:06:24.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那他的指甲呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about his fingernails?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.25,0:06:28.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  他就是个正常人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, look, he's just a normal guy...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.29,0:06:32.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有正常的眼睛  牙  和指甲\N{\fnArial\fs30}with normal eyes and teeth and fingernails.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.04,0:06:33.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 先生  没关系...  - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look, sir, it's okay if... - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.05,0:06:36.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.59,0:06:39.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那可是我的兄弟  这人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those were my brothers. This guy...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.76,0:06:43.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他杀了我的兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}he killed my brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.48,0:06:46.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,换你会是什么感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}How would you feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.61,0:06:52.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想象不出更可怕的事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't imagine anything worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.24,0:06:59.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道这不容易\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know this isn't easy,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.28,0:07:01.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但如果你还能记起什么细节...\N{\fnArial\fs30}but if you could remember any more details...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.66,0:07:03.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有件事  他有个...\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was one more thing. He had a, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.24,0:07:06.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡通人物文身在胳膊上\N{\fnArial\fs30}A tattoo on his arm of a cartoon character.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.41,0:07:10.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是那个...追哔哔鸟的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the guy who... He was chasing the Road Runner.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.88,0:07:12.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 大野狼  - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wile E. Coyote. - Yeah, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.80,0:07:15.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,凯尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kyle?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.01,0:07:17.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加里森医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Garrison.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.09,0:07:18.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you holding up?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.26,0:07:19.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还算好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, considering.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.76,0:07:21.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是凯尔的医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're, uh, Kyle's doctor?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.47,0:07:22.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.72,0:07:24.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以问你几个问题吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I just ask you a few questions?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.77,0:07:26.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.81,0:07:32.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不给我看看吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't I get to see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.49,0:07:39.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.15,0:07:42.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是...半成品\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it's a, you know, work in progress.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.20,0:07:47.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's... It's really...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.46,0:07:53.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊  这真是...艺术品  真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boy, this is a piece of, uh, art. Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.92,0:07:55.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得了  难道你能画得更好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, like you could've done it better.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.46,0:07:58.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,医生是怎么说凯尔的兄弟的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what did the doc have to say about Kyle's brothers?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.67,0:08:00.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说得不多  他们在现场就死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not much. They were DOA at the scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.38,0:08:02.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但他给我讲了验尸报告\N{\fnArial\fs30}He did give me the lowdown on the coroner's report.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.30,0:08:04.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我猜猜  他们的心不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me guess, their hearts were missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.05,0:08:05.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,并没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.14,0:08:07.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但他们肾脏  肺和肠子都缺了大块\N{\fnArial\fs30}But chunks of their kidneys, lungs and intestines.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.22,0:08:09.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恶心\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's just gross.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.23,0:08:11.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊  而且也绝不是狼人的行为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, also definitely not werewolf behavior.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.94,0:08:13.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那怎么  是恶魔吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what, a demon?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.77,0:08:14.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,袭击者可能被附身了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attacker could've been possessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.98,0:08:17.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恶魔怎么会袭击人时突然停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would a demon stop halfway through an attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.67,0:08:18.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think that...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.82,0:08:20.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could it...?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.44,0:08:22.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 嗯  我想不到  - 我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. I got nothing. - Me neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.74,0:08:28.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  我饿死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I am starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.93,0:08:31.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等  能量棒都哪去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, where are all the PowerBars?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.46,0:08:32.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你都吃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ate them all
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.87,0:08:33.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们还迷路了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we're lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.96,0:08:37.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们没迷路  小路就在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not lost. The path is right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.18,0:08:49.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.43,0:08:51.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.10,0:08:54.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,文明啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Civilization.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.56,0:08:55.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.02,0:08:56.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢天谢地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank God.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.20,0:09:10.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你俩还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you two doing okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.37,0:09:13.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 其实  我们...  - 迷路了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Actually, we're... - Lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.25,0:09:16.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这难免的  小路弯弯曲曲\N{\fnArial\fs30}It happens. The trail gets twisty...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.33,0:09:18.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且这里就我一户人家\N{\fnArial\fs30}and my house is the only one left up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.96,0:09:24.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可以给你们指路\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could point you in the right direction...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.55,0:09:26.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但恐怕你们要走好一阵才能回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I'm afraid it'll take a while to get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.43,0:09:32.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们真的在森林深处了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're really deep into the woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.14,0:09:36.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好样的  肯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice work, Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.94,0:09:42.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们要进来休息一下吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you like to come in and rest a bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.94,0:09:43.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.53,0:09:46.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢  但我们还是回去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, but we should head back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.86,0:09:48.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧  亲爱的  她都邀请我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, honey, she offered.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.41,0:09:51.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她就是个无害的老太太  还能怎么样啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's a harmless old lady. What could happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.98,0:10:17.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你确定你不想再来点了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure you don't want more?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.85,0:10:19.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不了  谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, thank you. It's...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.11,0:10:24.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我饱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm full.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.32,0:10:27.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们该走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.45,0:10:30.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们真对你感激不尽\N{\fnArial\fs30}We really can't thank you enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.16,0:10:35.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ken?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.79,0:10:38.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你...\N{\fnArial\fs30}You...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.54,0:10:40.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.92,0:10:43.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你...  - 我们...\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You...? - Are we...?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.42,0:10:45.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你给我们下药了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you drug us?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.15,0:11:03.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,朱莉  快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Julie, run.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.32,0:11:05.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.15,0:11:07.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求你  快停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, you have to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.78,0:11:09.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.11,0:11:12.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一切都会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.03,0:11:14.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你别动就好  亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just hold still now, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.09,0:11:24.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.50,0:11:26.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,停下  求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop, please stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.51,0:11:28.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为什么要这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.09,0:11:31.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.80,0:11:33.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.92,0:12:06.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.34,0:12:07.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们需要观察你的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to observe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.55,0:12:08.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吗  你体内可能还有药物\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. The drugs still may be in your system.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.96,0:12:10.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我得走了  我还有事要做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to go. I have things to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.88,0:12:13.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我得去做安排  - 那不急\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Arrangements I need to make. - It can wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.43,0:12:14.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你需要休息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you need to rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.39,0:12:16.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,留下吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.10,0:12:19.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be back in a few minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.60,0:12:24.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,警探\N{\fnArial\fs30}Detectives.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.61,0:12:25.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加里森医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Garrison.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.69,0:12:28.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这到底怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.03,0:12:30.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的小镇都发疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My whole town's going insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.49,0:12:32.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们查明白了马上告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll let you know as soon as we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.79,0:12:38.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沃森女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ms. Watson?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.41,0:12:42.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们需要问你几个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just need to ask you a few questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.46,0:12:44.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们还得再说一遍吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do we have to go over this again?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.88,0:12:45.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,非得现在说吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.96,0:12:47.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们会尽量不占用你太多时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll try to be brief.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.63,0:12:50.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沃森女士  能告诉我们你怎么逃走的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ms. Watson, can you tell us how you got away?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.59,0:12:55.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没像肯吃的那么多\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't eat as much as Ken did
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.84,0:12:57.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我还算清醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I wasn't as out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.60,0:13:02.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那老妇人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when the old woman was...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.98,0:13:06.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,砍杀肯时\N{\fnArial\fs30}carving up Ken...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.56,0:13:07.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我推了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shoved her
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.40,0:13:09.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她摔倒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and she fell.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.86,0:13:11.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,脑袋磕碎在了炉子上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cracked her head on the stove.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.49,0:13:15.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她死了  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's dead, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.07,0:13:17.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我...杀了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I...? I killed her?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.12,0:13:21.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道她为什么要这么对你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have any idea why she did this to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.66,0:13:22.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.00,0:13:23.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,前一刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}One minute...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.00,0:13:26.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她还是个好心老太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}she's just a sweet old lady...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.12,0:13:29.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,转眼间  她就变成了怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the next, she was like a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.46,0:13:32.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还记得别的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you remember anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.18,0:13:37.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.31,0:13:43.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们找到现场的那个小女孩了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you find a little girl there by any chance?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.81,0:13:44.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小女孩吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.52,0:13:46.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在房子那里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}At the house?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.19,0:13:49.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我好像看到她在窗外\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought I saw her outside the window.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.02,0:13:53.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她...就不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She... She just disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.03,0:13:56.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,凭空消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just vanished into thin air.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.95,0:14:00.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肯定是药的关系吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It must've been the drugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.03,0:14:03.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个消失的女孩  她什么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}This disappearing girl what did she look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.41,0:14:04.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这重要吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does it matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.58,0:14:06.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的  一切细节都很重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, every detail matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.21,0:14:13.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她有深色的头发\N{\fnArial\fs30}She had this dark, dark hair...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.21,0:14:15.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,苍白的皮肤\N{\fnArial\fs30}and really pale skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.42,0:14:16.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她大概八岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was around 8.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.63,0:14:19.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她是个很美的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was a beautiful child. It was...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.97,0:14:24.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在那样可怕的情况下看到她好奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}odd to see her in the middle of something so horrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.48,0:14:35.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到处都没看到有硫磺  电磁场怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, there's no sulfur anywhere. How about the EMF?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.74,0:14:38.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  爆表了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it's going nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.74,0:14:40.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但只在窗边有\N{\fnArial\fs30}But only over here by the window.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.62,0:14:42.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里绝对来过鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was definitely a spirit here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.41,0:14:44.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还站在犯罪现场外面看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who stood outside the crime scene and watched.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.75,0:14:47.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.12,0:14:49.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell do you make of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.29,0:14:50.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实  我有个理论\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, I do have a theory.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.46,0:14:52.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算是有吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sort of.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.05,0:14:53.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.17,0:14:56.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在想童话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, thinking about fairy tales.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.59,0:15:00.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好可爱啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's... That's nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.93,0:15:02.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你经常想童话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think about fairy tales often?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.18,0:15:04.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  迪恩  我是说这些凶案\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Dean, I'm talking about the murders.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.26,0:15:06.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一男一女  在林子里徒步\N{\fnArial\fs30}A guy and girl hiking through the woods...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.39,0:15:07.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,差点被个老太太吃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}an old lady tries to eat them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.02,0:15:09.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是《糖果屋》\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Hansel and Gretel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.35,0:15:10.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后还有三兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we got the three brothers
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.48,0:15:12.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为怎么建房吵了起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}arguing over how to build houses...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.36,0:15:13.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,随后遭到恶狼袭击\N{\fnArial\fs30}attacked by the big bad wolf.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.73,0:15:15.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 《三只小猪》  - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Three Little Pigs. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.82,0:15:17.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那三个家伙还真是挺胖的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, those guys were a little chubby.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.32,0:15:19.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等  那些故事的结局\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. I thought those things ended with
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.95,0:15:21.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不都是大家幸福地生活了下去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}everybody living happily ever after.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.66,0:15:23.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  原版可不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, not the originals.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.03,0:15:24.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,格林兄弟的故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, the Grimm brothers' stuff
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.16,0:15:26.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实是当时的民间传说\N{\fnArial\fs30}was kind of like the folklore of its day...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.37,0:15:28.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,充满了性  暴力和食人\N{\fnArial\fs30}full of sex, violence, cannibalism.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.91,0:15:30.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但故事随时间演变得和谐多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then it got sanitized over the years...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.54,0:15:33.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最终成了迪士尼电影和睡前故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}turned into Disney flicks and bedtime stories.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.21,0:15:37.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以你觉得凶案是故事重演吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you think the murders are, uh, what, a reenactment?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.59,0:15:38.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有点疯狂吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a little crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.59,0:15:39.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像什么一样疯狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crazy as what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.80,0:15:40.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们每天的生活吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every day of our lives?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.80,0:15:42.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Touche.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.93,0:15:44.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个瘆人的鬼姑娘怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's the creepy ghost girl involved?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.14,0:15:48.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她出现肯定是有原因的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, she must've been here for a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.52,0:15:50.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我敢打赌\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm willing to bet you top dollar
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.60,0:15:52.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她之前还出现在了建筑工地\N{\fnArial\fs30}she was at the construction site too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.81,0:15:54.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们现在得去做调研了  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta do research now, don't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.70,0:16:03.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 怎么样  - 查遍了他们的记录\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So? - Checked every record they had.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.20,0:16:05.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,儿童暴力死亡案件数\N{\fnArial\fs30}Found the usual amount of
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.03,0:16:06.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就这么大的小镇而言算是正常量\N{\fnArial\fs30}violent childhood deaths for a town this size.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.95,0:16:07.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.66,0:16:08.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道其中多少涉及黑头发\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna know how many were little girls,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.95,0:16:10.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,苍白皮肤的小女孩吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}with black hair and pale skin?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.16,0:16:12.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 零  - 零\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Zero. - Zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.92,0:16:13.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道有多少黑头发\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna know how many little girls
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.96,0:16:16.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,苍白皮肤的小女孩失踪了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}with black hair and pale skin have gone missing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.17,0:16:19.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又答对了  零  无  没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right again: Zip, zilch, nada.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.55,0:16:20.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托告诉我你有所发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me you got something good
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.51,0:16:22.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我完全浪费了六个小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}because I've totally wasted the last six hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.51,0:16:25.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你听说过莉莉安·贝利吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you ever hear of Lillian Bailey?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.18,0:16:27.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是1930年代的一个英国灵媒\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was a British medium from the 1930s.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.97,0:16:29.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她喜欢童话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}She got a thing for fairy tales?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.64,0:16:30.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是  是出神\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, trances.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.02,0:16:34.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她会进入不省人事的状态  听好\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, she'd go into these unconscious states where, get this,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.35,0:16:38.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而她的思维和行为都会完全被鬼魂控制\N{\fnArial\fs30}her thoughts and actions were completely controlled by spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.65,0:16:40.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鬼傀儡师\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ghost Puppet Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.11,0:16:40.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.65,0:16:41.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得这孩子就在这么做吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think that's what this kid is doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.20,0:16:43.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让大灰狼和老太婆进入出神状态\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sending Wolfboy and Grandma into trances,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.82,0:16:45.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让他们疯狂杀戮\N{\fnArial\fs30}making them go kill-crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.16,0:16:46.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It could be.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.53,0:16:50.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像鬼魂催眠\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, kind of like a spirit hypnosis or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.41,0:16:52.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出神我理解  但童话出神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trances I get, but fairy-tale trances?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.04,0:16:54.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,即便对于我们也够怪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's bizarre even for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.71,0:17:01.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说得对  这真是正常呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you're right. That's completely normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.09,0:17:05.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  或许真是童话\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, maybe it is fairy tales.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.22,0:17:08.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,非常糟糕的童话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Totally messed-up fairy tales.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.72,0:17:12.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉你  我绝不亲青蛙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tell you one thing, there's no way I'm kissing a damn frog.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.02,0:17:17.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check that out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.03,0:17:21.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了  万圣节要到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? It's close to Halloween.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.53,0:17:24.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记得《灰姑娘》吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You remember Cinderella?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.36,0:17:27.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,变成马车的南瓜\N{\fnArial\fs30}With the pumpkin that turns into a coach
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.57,0:17:29.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和变成马的老鼠\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the mice that become horses?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.04,0:17:34.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哥们  你还能更基点吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, could you be more gay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.71,0:17:39.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别回答\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't answer that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.31,0:17:53.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁知道呢  或许你能找到你的仙女教母\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, who knows? Maybe you'll find your fairy godmother.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.25,0:18:21.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救命  我在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help, I'm in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.13,0:18:25.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别担心  没事  我们来了  我们会救你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry, it's okay. We're here. We got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.72,0:18:27.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帮帮我  她疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to help me. She's a lunatic.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.26,0:18:27.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.97,0:18:30.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我继母  她发狂了  冲我大吼\N{\fnArial\fs30}My stepmom, she just freaked out, screamed at me,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.39,0:18:31.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打我  还把我铐了起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}beat me, chained me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.93,0:18:33.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 她人呢  - 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where is she now? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.56,0:18:35.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.32,0:19:28.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.64,0:19:58.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,医务人员接走了灰姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Paramedics picked up Cinderella.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.56,0:19:59.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 好啊  - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's good. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.81,0:20:02.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小女孩  大红苹果\N{\fnArial\fs30}So little girl, shiny red apple.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.73,0:20:04.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你应该明白这意味着什么吧  童话小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm guessing that means something to you, fairy tale boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.73,0:20:05.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得是《白雪公主》\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's Snow White.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.61,0:20:07.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,, 《白雪公主》\N{\fnArial\fs30}Snow White?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.28,0:20:08.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看过那部电影\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw that movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.94,0:20:10.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,至少看过色情片版的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, the porn version anyways.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.28,0:20:12.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有个邪恶继母\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was this wicked stepmother.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.95,0:20:13.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她还真是邪啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was wicked.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.49,0:20:15.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,的确有个邪恶继母\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is a wicked stepmother...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.41,0:20:17.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她企图用毒苹果害死白雪公主\N{\fnArial\fs30}and she tries to kill Snow White with a poisoned apple.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.24,0:20:20.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但苹果并没害死那姑娘  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the apple doesn't actually kill the girl, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.33,0:20:21.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.12,0:20:22.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让她陷入深眠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Puts her into a deep sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.79,0:20:24.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像个活死人\N{\fnArial\fs30}So deep, it's almost like she's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.01,0:20:33.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有  抱歉  我们没有陷入昏迷的小女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, sorry. We don't have any comatose little girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.05,0:20:35.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你确定吗  - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you sure? - Totally.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.80,0:20:37.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,昏迷病人大都是老人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's mostly old guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.60,0:20:39.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有卡莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, well, Callie.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.14,0:20:40.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她在我来之前就入院了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's been around since before I started here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.85,0:20:41.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Callie?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.56,0:20:43.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  太悲惨了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it's so sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.44,0:20:45.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可怜的加里森医生  他不肯放弃她\N{\fnArial\fs30}And poor Dr. Garrison, he just won't give up on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.73,0:20:47.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡莉是他的病人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was Callie one of his patients?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.19,0:20:49.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  是他女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, his daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.45,0:20:56.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.41,0:21:02.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"按下门栓就行"  外婆喊道\N{\fnArial\fs30}"'Just press the latch,' called out the grandmother."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.04,0:21:03.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"我太虚弱了  无法起身"\N{\fnArial\fs30}'I'm too weak to get up.'
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.33,0:21:07.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大恶狼按下门栓  门开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The wolf pressed the latch and the door opened.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.34,0:21:10.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他走进去  直扑向了外婆\N{\fnArial\fs30}He stepped inside, went straight to the grandmother...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.84,0:21:12.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吃了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}"...and ate her up. "
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.47,0:21:17.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太感谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.92,0:21:50.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,猎人走进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The huntsman stepped inside
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.21,0:21:52.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,床上躺着大恶狼\N{\fnArial\fs30}and in the bed lay the wolf."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.21,0:21:55.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,于是猎人拿起剪刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}So the huntsman took a pair of scissors...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.97,0:21:58.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,切开了大恶狼的肚皮\N{\fnArial\fs30}"And cut open the wolf's belly."
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.11,0:22:12.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,警探  有什么事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Detectives, can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.03,0:22:16.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们刚听说卡莉是你女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just heard that Callie is your daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.11,0:22:18.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们想说一声我们很为您遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we wanted to say how very sorry we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.82,0:22:21.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, um, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.58,0:22:23.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,失陪一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you'll excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.20,0:22:26.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们正要往这边走  我们陪你吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're heading this way, we'll walk with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.21,0:22:28.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡莉昏迷这样多久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long has Callie been like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.08,0:22:30.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们无意打探\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't mean to intrude.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.13,0:22:31.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们无法想象\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't possibly understand
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.38,0:22:33.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看到她这副样子心里会多难过\N{\fnArial\fs30}how hard it must be for you seeing her like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.34,0:22:36.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊  是不容易\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it's not easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.18,0:22:40.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她从八岁起就陷入了昏迷\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's, uh, been here since she was 8 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.93,0:22:42.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她是那时中毒的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's when she was poisoned?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.26,0:22:44.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  吞了漂白剂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, swallowed bleach.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.97,0:22:47.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一直不知道她怎么会拿到那东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never figure out how she got her hands on the bottle.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.98,0:22:50.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我妻子发现了她  带她来了急诊室\N{\fnArial\fs30}My wife found her, brought her to the ER.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.19,0:22:52.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我当时正好当班\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, and I was on call.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.77,0:22:54.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你妻子...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your wife was, uh...?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.73,0:22:55.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是卡莉的继母吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was that Callie's stepmother?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.53,0:23:02.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的  你怎么知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, yes. How'd you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.08,0:23:03.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,猜的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucky guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.62,0:23:09.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,朱莉是卡莉唯一知道的母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Julie was the only mother that, uh, Callie ever knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.25,0:23:12.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我妻子去年过世了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My wife passed away last year and...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.84,0:23:15.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在只剩我和我女儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's just my daughter and me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.59,0:23:18.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只剩她了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's all I got left.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.42,0:23:21.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,X光技术员  分机2407\N{\fnArial\fs30}X-ray tech, extension 2407.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.44,0:23:24.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 失陪  我得回去工作了  - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Excuse me, I've gotta get back to work. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.77,0:23:32.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说对了  妥妥的白雪公主\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you're right. It's Snow White in spades.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.40,0:23:35.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊  继母毒害女孩  害她陷入深眠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yup. Stepmom poisons the girl, puts her into a deep sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.11,0:23:37.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说是什么动机\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the motive, you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.82,0:23:39.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能是像米莎·巴顿那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could be like Mischa Barton.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.49,0:23:41.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,, 《灵异第六感》不是《橘子郡男孩》\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sixth Sense, not The O. C.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.07,0:23:42.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.48,0:23:45.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你了解童话  我了解电影\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know fairy tales, I know movies.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.08,0:23:46.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她演了那个苍白的鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}She played the pasty ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.99,0:23:49.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就她妈妈有那个毛病\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, remember the mom had that thing, you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.58,0:23:51.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让孩子生病  好博关注\N{\fnArial\fs30}where you keep the kid sick so you get the attention?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.71,0:23:52.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.88,0:23:54.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,代理型孟乔森综合征\N{\fnArial\fs30}Munchausen syndrome by proxy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.46,0:23:55.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could be.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.96,0:23:58.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许那么多年来  卡莉一直默默承受着\N{\fnArial\fs30}So say all these years, Callie's been suffering silently...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.71,0:24:01.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为没人知道亲爱的老妈做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}because nobody knows the truth about what Mommy Dearest did.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.18,0:24:01.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,过了这么久\N{\fnArial\fs30}And after all this time,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.97,0:24:03.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她的鬼魂越来越愤怒\N{\fnArial\fs30}her spirit just gets angrier and angrier,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.89,0:24:05.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,直到终于开始发脾气\N{\fnArial\fs30}until it finally just starts lashing out.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.81,0:24:07.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而与此同时  她还一直听着老爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meanwhile, she has to listen to Dad
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.56,0:24:09.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给她讲各种疯狂的故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}tell her these deranged stories...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.02,0:24:11.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么疯狼  食人老妇\N{\fnArial\fs30}about a rabid wolf or a cannibalistic old lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.35,0:24:12.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这足以把任何人逼疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's enough to drive anybody nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.73,0:24:14.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  但我们怎么阻止她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, but how are we gonna stop her?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.77,0:24:17.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡莉困在这里了  她父亲在用机器维系她的生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, Callie's stuck here. Her father's keeping her body alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.69,0:24:19.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样想烧她尸骨的确有难度\N{\fnArial\fs30}It does make it a bit hard to burn the bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.36,0:24:20.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还用说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.40,0:24:21.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coming in.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.11,0:24:22.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你把好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.66,0:24:29.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她情况如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's her status?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.87,0:24:30.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,72岁老妇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seventy-two-year-old female.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.96,0:24:33.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多处撕裂伤和穿刺伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sustained multiple lacerations and puncture wounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.17,0:24:36.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,血压80/40  还在降低  窦性心搏过速\N{\fnArial\fs30}BP is 80/40 and falling. Sinus tachycardia.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.59,0:24:37.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是咬伤吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that a bite?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.59,0:24:40.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她似乎是被疯狗或狼咬了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It looks like she was mauled by a mad dog or maybe a wolf.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.84,0:24:43.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加里森医生给卡莉读的最后的故事是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was the last story Dr. Garrison was reading Callie?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.47,0:24:44.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,, 《小红帽》\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little Red Riding Hood.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.35,0:24:53.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.85,0:24:56.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她是唯一的受害人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was she the only victim?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.90,0:24:59.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她被发现时躺在路边  奄奄一息\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was found by the side of the road, barely alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.48,0:25:00.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,独自一人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.15,0:25:01.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们需要找到她的亲属\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to find her next of kin.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.45,0:25:05.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  她有个外孙女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. She has a granddaughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.91,0:25:06.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有地址吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have an address?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.41,0:25:09.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.29,0:25:09.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.40,0:25:14.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想办法阻止卡莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You find a way to stop Callie, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.83,0:25:15.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.79,0:25:18.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要去阻止大恶狼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna go stop the big bad wolf.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.21,0:25:20.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我说过的最奇怪的话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is the weirdest thing I've ever said.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.90,0:25:49.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,外婆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grandma.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.19,0:26:19.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加里森医生  我需要跟你谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Garrison, I need to speak with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.86,0:26:21.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,警探  有什么事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Detective, what can I do for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.44,0:26:22.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.11,0:26:24.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是关于卡莉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's about Callie.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.66,0:26:25.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我女儿  她怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My daughter? What about her?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.20,0:26:30.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许...我们可以坐下谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, maybe, maybe, could we sit down for a minute?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.12,0:26:31.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行  她怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. What about her?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.78,0:26:32.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.25,0:26:37.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,医生  这会让你很不好受\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, doctor, this isn't gonna be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.58,0:26:41.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡莉的事不是意外\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to Callie was not an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.50,0:26:42.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.25,0:26:43.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很抱歉  但这是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry but it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.67,0:26:45.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你才不知道我女儿遭遇了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have no idea what happened to my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.72,0:26:49.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有些事你不知道  医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are things you don't know, doctor...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.64,0:26:50.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,关于你妻子的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}about your wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.72,0:26:51.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}My wife?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.97,0:26:54.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,医生  是你妻子给卡莉下了毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doctor, your wife poisoned Callie.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.23,0:27:01.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为什么要对我说这种可怕的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would you say something so horrible to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.19,0:27:02.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我需要你帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.07,0:27:05.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你远离我和我女儿  听到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stay away from me and from my daughter, you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.57,0:27:08.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,医生  这不是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doctor, this isn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.07,0:27:09.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, if...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.38,0:27:22.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要叫保安了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm calling security.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.75,0:27:23.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, listen,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.34,0:27:24.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没时间跟你好声好气了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have time to do this gently.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.63,0:27:26.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你不听我的  会有更多人受伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you don't listen to me, more people are gonna get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.42,0:27:28.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为卡莉要伤害他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because Callie is going to hurt them.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.55,0:27:29.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.51,0:27:31.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会觉得我疯了  但请听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna think I'm crazy, but just understand me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.72,0:27:34.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你女儿卡莉  她还在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your daughter, Callie, is still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.22,0:27:37.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她是个鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's a spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.66,0:28:01.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以你也看到她了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you've seen her too?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.81,0:28:22.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.64,0:28:23.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.00,0:28:41.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我能感觉到她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sensed her.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.79,0:28:43.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Callie.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.46,0:28:46.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她的存在  她的气息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her presence, her scent.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.25,0:28:49.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我甚至看到她站在我床脚  但我从未...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I even saw her standing at the foot of my bed, but I never...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.26,0:28:52.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,相信过  我以为那是做梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}believed it. I thought I was dreaming...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.80,0:28:54.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那不是做梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.72,0:28:56.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她看上去还是八岁时的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}She looks like she did when she was 8.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.55,0:28:58.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,白裙子\N{\fnArial\fs30}White dress.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.35,0:29:00.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,头发上有红缎带\N{\fnArial\fs30}Red ribbon in her hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.98,0:29:04.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她一直想对你说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's been trying to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.31,0:29:07.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不是警察  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not a cop, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.94,0:29:08.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.77,0:29:09.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你是什么人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.07,0:29:12.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是对这种事有所了解的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone who knows a little bit about this kind of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.36,0:29:14.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你说我妻子给卡莉下了毒...\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what you said about my wife poisoning Callie, that...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.40,0:29:17.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先生  是卡莉告诉我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, Callie told us.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.62,0:29:19.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 什么  - 并非是用语言\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Not in so many words.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.87,0:29:21.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是以她自己的方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}But in her own way...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.75,0:29:23.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她告诉我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}she told us.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.00,0:29:26.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我妻子爱卡莉  那怎么可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}My wife loved Callie. So how is that possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.67,0:29:28.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道  但就是如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, but it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.67,0:29:30.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  我不信\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, I don't believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.59,0:29:33.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡莉在杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Callie is killing people.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.59,0:29:35.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她很愤怒  很绝望\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's angry, she's desperate...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.93,0:29:38.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为没人肯听她的\N{\fnArial\fs30}because nobody will listen to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.18,0:29:40.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以你必须聆听她\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you have to listen to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.02,0:29:42.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.98,0:29:45.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好好聆听你女儿吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}listen to your daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.04,0:30:09.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Callie?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.09,0:30:12.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡莉  是爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Callie, it's Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.09,0:30:15.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我  爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's me, Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.47,0:30:17.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it true?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.09,0:30:19.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是妈妈害了你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did Mommy do that to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.01,0:30:24.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道我之前没好好听  但我现在听了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know I wasn't listening before, but I'm listening now.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.73,0:30:26.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸在呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.10,0:30:30.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托  亲爱的  你能告诉我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, honey. Is there any way you can tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.94,0:30:33.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.80,0:30:55.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it true?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.23,0:31:13.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真对不起  宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.90,0:31:17.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}But listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.40,0:31:20.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你必须停下你在做的事  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta stop what you're doing, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.03,0:31:23.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在伤害人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're hurting people.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.95,0:31:27.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我现在什么都知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know everything now.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.46,0:31:31.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道真相了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.71,0:31:37.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你该放手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time for you to let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.30,0:31:41.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我该对你放手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time for me to let you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.50,0:32:18.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop, stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.71,0:32:19.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.55,0:32:22.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.93,0:32:23.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.33,0:32:54.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,X光技术员  分机...\N{\fnArial\fs30}X-ray tech, extension...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.88,0:32:56.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那姑娘没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the girl's okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.31,0:33:01.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那真的结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So it's really over.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.38,0:33:03.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.93,0:33:04.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多亏了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}All thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.76,0:33:08.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡莉曾是我生命中最重要的部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Callie was the most important thing in my life...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.72,0:33:12.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我早该对她放手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I should've let her go a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.94,0:33:14.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回见了  医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you around, doc.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.52,0:33:17.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望不会再见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sure hope not.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.32,0:33:25.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他说的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what he said?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.66,0:33:27.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是好建议\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some good advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.20,0:33:33.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你希望我那么做吗  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that what you want me to do, Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.79,0:33:36.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对你放手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just let you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.91,0:35:40.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎呦  小萨姆·温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, little Sammy Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.37,0:35:42.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真感动\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm touched.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.04,0:35:46.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你哥哥来见过我两次了  但你...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, your brother's been to see me twice, but you...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.96,0:35:49.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还未曾有幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never had the pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.93,0:35:53.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我能为你做什么  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can I do for you, Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.51,0:35:57.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以求饶\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can beg for your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.10,0:36:01.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们本来聊得好好的呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were having such a nice conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.73,0:36:03.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你非要破坏气氛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you had to go and ruin the mood.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.48,0:36:06.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我是你  就不再耍嘴皮  开始害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I were you, I'd drop the wisecracks and start acting scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.19,0:36:10.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那不是我的风格\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not my style.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.41,0:36:15.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那不是原本的柯尔特枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not the original Colt.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.58,0:36:18.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你从哪弄到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did you get that?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.50,0:36:24.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,露比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ruby.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.38,0:36:26.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肯定是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Had to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.75,0:36:29.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她真是个麻烦精\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is such a pain in my ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.63,0:36:31.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她会有应得的下场的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'll get what's coming to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.55,0:36:34.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你等着瞧吧  - 够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You can count on it. - That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.59,0:36:36.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来是有个提议给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I came here to make you an offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.35,0:36:38.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有提议给我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna make me an offer?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.35,0:36:40.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真可爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.43,0:36:42.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你马上解除迪恩的交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can let Dean out of his deal right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.27,0:36:46.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他活  我活  你也活\N{\fnArial\fs30}He lives, I live, you live.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.56,0:36:48.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家皆大欢喜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone goes home happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.23,0:36:49.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,否则\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.28,0:36:55.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你永远停止呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}you stop breathing. Permanently.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.50,0:37:08.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么强硬\N{\fnArial\fs30}All this tough talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.00,0:37:11.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我得告诉你  不怎么让人信服\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to tell you, it's not very convincing.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.22,0:37:13.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, come on, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.63,0:37:16.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真想破坏交易吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you even wanna break the deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.72,0:37:17.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.89,0:37:20.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.56,0:37:24.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还没受够给迪恩收拾烂摊子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aren't you tired of cleaning up Dean's messes?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.44,0:37:26.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或是应付他破碎的心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of dealing with that broken psyche of his?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.19,0:37:29.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还没受够被他呼来喝去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aren't you tired of being bossed around
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.27,0:37:30.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像个乳臭未干的小弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}like a snot-nosed little brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.98,0:37:33.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你比迪恩强大  你比他好\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're stronger than Dean, you're better than him.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.90,0:37:34.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说话小心点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.95,0:37:35.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,承认吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Admit it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.03,0:37:38.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你只是来走个过场\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're here, going through the motions.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.37,0:37:41.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实  等他不在了  你会有那么一丝解脱\N{\fnArial\fs30}The truth is you'll be a tiny bit relieved when he's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.54,0:37:42.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.16,0:37:45.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,摆脱了绝望  大意  粘人的迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more desperate, sloppy, needy Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.21,0:37:49.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你终于能自由了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can finally be free.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.84,0:37:52.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说了  闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said, shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.18,0:37:59.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要我说  你反驳得太激烈了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doth protest too much if you ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.85,0:38:01.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了  我受够你的胡扯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I've had enough of your crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.81,0:38:03.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你马上解除迪恩的交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}You let Dean out of his deal right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.77,0:38:06.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉  亲爱的  但你哥哥是成年人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, sweetheart, but your brother's an adult.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.81,0:38:10.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他自愿做了那个交易  公平公正\N{\fnArial\fs30}He made that deal of his own free will. Fair and square.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.40,0:38:12.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,牢不可破\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's ironclad.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.78,0:38:14.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每个交易都可以打破\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every deal can be broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.45,0:38:16.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.61,0:38:19.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啊  那我杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine, then I'll kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.37,0:38:20.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你不在了  交易也就不在了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're gone, so is the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.87,0:38:22.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,猜错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess again.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.04,0:38:24.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.16,0:38:27.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,萨姆  我只是推销的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, I'm just a saleswoman.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.83,0:38:29.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也像其他人一样有老板\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a boss like everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.50,0:38:32.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,合同在他手里  不在我手里\N{\fnArial\fs30}He holds the contract, not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.50,0:38:34.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他很想要迪恩的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wants Dean's soul, bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.30,0:38:36.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,相信我  他不会放手的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And believe me, he's not gonna let it go.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.88,0:38:37.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在唬人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're bluffing.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.84,0:38:38.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.68,0:38:41.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打死我吧  如果能让你爽一把\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoot me, if it'll get you off.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.30,0:38:42.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但交易不会被打破\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the deal still holds.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.81,0:38:45.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等迪恩大限到了  他会被拖入深渊\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when Dean's time is up, he's getting dragged into the pit.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.85,0:38:47.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你的老板是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then who's your boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.44,0:38:48.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,合同在谁手里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who holds the contract?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.23,0:38:52.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我告诉你  他可不像我这么温柔\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not as cuddly as me, I can tell you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.19,0:38:53.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.15,0:38:56.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不能告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.57,0:38:58.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Sam...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.24,0:39:00.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这事没有出路\N{\fnArial\fs30}but there's no way out of this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.41,0:39:03.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not this time.

